  "homeSampleScript": "# Sample script\n\n## Opening\n[CAM 1] Hello and **welcome** to PromptFlow. This sample script shows\nthe available markers. [PAUSE 2s]\n\nYou can put words in **bold** for emphasis, or ==highlight== them\nwhen they matter.\n\n## Demo\n[CAM 2] [CUE Demo] Now we switch cameras. Automatic pauses stop the text\nfor a few seconds and then continue on their own. [PAUSE 1.5s]\n\nA pause without a duration stops the text until you press Play. [PAUSE]\n\n## Closing\n[CAM 1] Thanks for watching. Control the prompter from your phone with\n**Remote control** mode, or with a Bluetooth pedal.\n",
  "@homeSampleScript": {
    "description": "Sample script in Markdown. Translate the prose and the section titles. Keep EXACTLY the markup: '#', '##', '**…**', '==…==', and the tags [CAM 1], [CAM 2], [CUE Demo], [PAUSE 2s], [PAUSE 1.5s], [PAUSE] in English and unchanged."
  },
